          "label": "Still drives, and I'm worried",
          "tags": [
            "need:driving"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "none",
          "label": "None of these yet",
          "tags": [],
          "exclusive": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reassure_1",
      "type": "interstitial",
      "speaker": "rosa",
      "title": "You're not alone.",
      "body": "About 1 in 4 adults in the US cares for a family member, and most never got any training. Knowing what to say and do is a skill. You can learn it, one step at a time.",
      "cta": "Continue"
    },
    {
      "id": "q6_living",
